al_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p013:m0366","start":366,"end":368,"surface":"王波","kind":"person","person_id":"z0g_ak2_edy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p013:m0369","start":369,"end":370,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"0c9_95a_18b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p013:m0386","start":386,"end":387,"surface":"勒","kind":"person","person_id":"0c9_95a_18b","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":101,"last_line":101,"revision_id":2506399,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peikai-ws2506399"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004","text":"黃初元年奉使賀文帝踐阼而道路得疾故計遠近為稽留及羣臣歡㑹帝正色責之曰昔禹㑹諸侯於塗山防風後至便行大戮今溥天同慶而卿最留遲何也淮對曰臣聞五帝先教導民以徳夏后政衰始用刑辟今臣遭唐虞之世是以自知免於防風之誅也帝悅之擢領雍州刺史封射陽亭侯五年為真安定羌大帥辟蹏反討破降之每羌胡來降淮輒先使人推問其親理男女多少年歲長幼及見一一知其欵曲訊問周至咸稱神明","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","source_position":{"first_line":315,"last_line":324,"revision_id":"214fcafa79894355909c9d8c2c1533089e7791c6","projection_sha256":"9358dea2079e905b63d304ec217caa8d27e3105715d319556225d94aba532f9b","source_fragments":[{"line":315,"raw_start":6,"raw_end":21,"text":"黃初元年奉使賀文帝踐阼而道路得"},{"line":316,"raw_start":0,"raw_end":21,"text":"疾故計遠近為稽留及羣臣歡㑹帝正色責之曰昔禹"},{"line":317,"raw_start":0,"raw_end":21,"text":"㑹諸侯於塗山防風後至便行大戮今溥天同慶而卿"},{"line":318,"raw_start":0,"raw_end":21,"text":"最留遲何也淮對曰臣聞五帝先教導民以徳夏后政"},{"line":320,"raw_start":0,"raw_end":21,"text":"衰始用刑辟今臣遭唐虞之世是以自知免於防風之"},{"line":321,"raw_start":0,"raw_end":21,"text":"誅也帝悅之擢領雍州刺史封射陽亭侯五年為真安"},{"line":322,"raw_start":0,"raw_end":21,"text":"定羌大帥辟蹏反討破降之每羌胡來降淮輒先使人"},{"line":323,"raw_start":0,"raw_end":21,"text":"推問其親理男女多少年歲長幼及見一一知其欵曲"},{"line":324,"raw_start":0,"raw_end":8,"text":"訊問周至咸稱神明"}],"source_layer":"received_biography"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"tix_jqk_w1o","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本unit003五官將→魏王，unit004黃初元年踐阼；與009曹休p003及022盧毓p003–004文帝五官將/踐阼相合，非晉045司馬昭。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"tix_jqk_w1o","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本unit003五官將→魏王，unit004黃初元年踐阼；與009曹休p003及022盧毓p003–004文帝五官將/踐阼相合，非晉045司馬昭。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"owj_whw_zzm","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"史記孔子世家會稽問骨單元禹會諸侯、防風後至被戮，與本曹丕引塗山防風同敘事傳統；僅傳說引古身份，不以為實事已證。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"防風","kind":"person","person_id":"h72_e8m_q6q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"與禹同一會諸侯後至被戮典故；既錄孔子世家防風氏問骨故事。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"卿","kind":"person","person_id":"d7u_f1n_let","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"022陳泰p010與本unit012同述征西將軍郭淮、雍州刺史陳泰協降句安於翅上；職名/雙人/敵將/地名共同事件明確。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"淮","kind":"person","person_id":"d7u_f1n_let","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"022陳泰p010與本unit012同述征西將軍郭淮、雍州刺史陳泰協降句安於翅上；職名/雙人/敵將/地名共同事件明確。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"d7u_f1n_let","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"022陳泰p010與本unit012同述征西將軍郭淮、雍州刺史陳泰協降句安於翅上；職名/雙人/敵將/地名共同事件明確。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0084","start":84,"end":85,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"d7u_f1n_let","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"022陳泰p010與本unit012同述征西將軍郭淮、雍州刺史陳泰協降句安於翅上；職名/雙人/敵將/地名共同事件明確。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"防風","kind":"person","person_id":"h72_e8m_q6q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"與禹同一會諸侯後至被戮典故；既錄孔子世家防風氏問骨故事。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0101","start":101,"end":102,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"tix_jqk_w1o","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本unit003五官將→魏王，unit004黃初元年踐阼；與009曹休p003及022盧毓p003–004文帝五官將/踐阼相合，非晉045司馬昭。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"辟蹏","kind":"person","person_id":"d6g_byb_gho","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"黃初五年安定羌大帥反，郭淮討降；不與太和隴西唐蹏因字近合。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai:unit004:m0136","start":136,"end":137,"surface":"淮","kind":"person","person_id":"d7u_f1n_let","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"022陳泰p010與本unit012同述征西將軍郭淮、雍州刺史陳泰協降句安於翅上；職名/雙人/敵將/地名共同事件明確。"}],"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-026-guohuai","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-026","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-026-guohuai"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p012","text":"吳伐越，墮會稽，得骨節專車。吳使使問仲尼：「骨何者最大？」仲尼曰：「禹致羣神於會稽山，防風氏後至，禹殺而戮之，其節專車，此為大矣。」吳客曰：「誰為神？」仲尼曰：「山川之神足以綱紀天下，其守為神，社稷為公侯，皆屬於王者。」客曰：「防風何守？」仲尼曰：「汪罔氏之君守封、禺之山，為釐姓。在虞、夏、商為汪罔，於周為長翟，今謂之大人。」客曰：「人長幾何？」仲尼曰：「僬僥氏三尺，短之至也。長者不過十之，數之極也。」於是吳客曰：「善哉聖人！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m012-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m012-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m012-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"owj_whw_zzm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m012-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"羣神","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m012-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"防風氏","kind":"person","person_id":"h72_e8m_q6q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-